<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Corp Express yr net loss A$5.95 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Corp Express yr net loss A$5.95 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 1</p>
<p>		(million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating loss		    3.21 vs  profit 3.25</p>
<p>    Net loss			    5.95 vs  profit 1.89</p>
<p>    Sales			     285.87 vs 131.18</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Corporate Express Australia Ltd is controlled by Corporate Express Inc.It said comparative results reflect a seven month period.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
